  "statement": "I appreciate the emphasis on integrating security measures into the safety architecture (SAF-01) and the support for timely HMI warnings (RES-05). However, I must emphasize that optimizing for minimum travel time (EFF-01) is vital for overall efficiency and user experience. I propose a synthesis where we can define acceptable energy consumption thresholds during Minimal Risk Maneuvers (SAF-02), allowing for both safety and performance efficiency. This approach ensures that we do not compromise on quick response times while still being mindful of energy consumption during emergencies.",
